{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55959","headline":"纸帐诗 · 李观象","name":"纸帐诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清悬四面剡溪霜，高卧梅花月半牀。\n花瓮有天春不老，瑶台无夜月生香。\n觉来虚白神光发，睡去清闲好梦长。\n一枕总无尘土气，何妨留我白云乡。\n（《坚瓠甲集》卷一）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李观象","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55959.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55959","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}